  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your body has built-in defensive layers, which can be enhanced with armor. You gain a +1 bonus to Armor Class. You can don only armor with which you have proficiency. To don armor, you must incorporate it into your body over the course of 1 hour, which can be done as part of a rest. To doff armor, you must spend 1 hour removing it. While you live, your armor can't be removed from your body against your will.</p>",
